Or browse online:
  https://github.com/Nan0pk/Rush-linux/tree/graphify-data/graphify-out

Why this separation?
- Main branch history shows engineering changes only (no 37% noise)
- Graphify artifacts are ~1MB and change frequently
- Agents without graphify CLI fall back to docs/docmap.toml (unchanged)
